nation/document-parsing#schema-loading","content":"Inline JSON Schema string."},"576":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-66","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#schema-loading","content":"Schema loading from URLs sends `Accept: application/schema+json, application/json` headers."},"577":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-67","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#custom-parsers","content":"There are three ways to extend Struktur with support for new file formats:"},"578":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-68","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#custom-parsers","content":"**Configuration-level (recommended):** `struktur config parsers add` — zero code, works in CLI and SDK via `parserConfig`"},"579":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-69","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#custom-parsers","content":"**SDK-level inline parser:** Add an `InlineParserDef` to `parserConfig` — code-only, works with `parse()`"},"580":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-70","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#custom-parsers","content":"**Legacy providers:** Use the deprecated `providers` registry with `fileToArtifact()`"},"581":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-71","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing#option-1-configuration-level-recommended","content":"Register a parser by MIME type using the CLI. This works transparently for all `--input` and `parse` calls."},"582":{"id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing-72","page_id":"/docs/explanation/document-parsing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/expla